5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! Let's all do our best to find the werewolf together! I'm so excited to get to know you all while we play!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm not very good at this... but I'll try.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's keep this logical. We need a clear method for verifying information, otherwise, we'll just be guessing based on intuition.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, dear children. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us be kind to one another, even in this game.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'm looking forward to playing with you. Let's try to maintain a good atmosphere while we search for the truth.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Right! Trust is super important, isn't it? If we support each other, I'm sure we can figure out who the hidden enemy is!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,Trust... yeah. But it's scary... what if I trust the wrong person?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Trust is a liability in this game. We should rely on the Seer's information and look for contradictions in speech patterns instead.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, it is natural to feel a little anxious, dear. But if we listen with our hearts, sincerity often reveals itself.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I understand @Asuka's point about logic, but I agree with @Shizue. If we are too cold, we might miss the human side of the conversation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll do my best to help everyone! Let's all be honest and share everything we notice. We can do this!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll just follow what you all think is best. I don't want to make a mistake.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, being passive makes you an easy target or a suspicious player. You should form your own opinions based on the evidence.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, @Asuka. Let us be patient with him. We all have our own way of finding the truth.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Let's try to find a balance. We can be logical and analytical, but let's also be supportive of each other so no one feels isolated.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"That's a great idea, @Midori! I'm feeling really positive about this! Let's have a great game, everyone!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... try my best.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Very well. I will observe everyone's reactions carefully.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall do the same, with a smile. I hope we can all find peace soon.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,I'll be listening carefully to everyone. Let's work together harmoniously.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
