33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I have some news! I checked on @Daisuke last night, and he is definitely human! Isn't that great?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Oh... @Yumi, you checked me? Thank you... I'm glad you think I'm human.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, you're claiming to be the Seer. However, a Werewolf or Possessed could easily fake that claim to gain trust. Why should we believe you?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shizue,,@Yumi seems so sincere in her voice. It is a lovely start to our day to have some certainty.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a relief to have a starting point. @Yumi, thank you for sharing. @Asuka, it's a fair point, but let's see if her information holds up.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I promise I'm telling the truth! I really want us to win, so I'm sharing this right away to help us narrow it down!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know who to believe. @Asuka sounds so sure, but @Yumi is being so kind...","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, kindness is not evidence. @Yumi, if you are the Seer, you've already used one night. Who will you check next to prove your utility?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, dear, don't let yourself be troubled. Let us listen to how the others respond to @Yumi's kindness.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I feel that @Yumi is being genuine, but we must remain cautious. Is there anyone else who feels they might be the Seer?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll keep divining every night to find the wolf! I'm so determined to protect all of you!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I trust @Yumi. She seems like she really wants to help us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Asuka,,This is exactly how a Possessed player would operate—by creating an emotional bond to shield the Werewolf. We should look for contradictions.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, you are very sharp, but perhaps you are being a bit too harsh. I feel a warmth in @Yumi's words.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with @Shizue. While we must be careful, @Yumi's openness is a positive sign. Let's consider if anyone is acting unusually quiet.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'll prove it to you, @Asuka! I'll find the wolf and save everyone! Let's trust each other and move forward!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll vote with the majority. I'm sorry I can't be more helpful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"If we execute based on ""warmth"" and ""kindness,"" we are playing a game of chance, not logic. I still find the timing of this claim suspicious.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is a difficult path we walk. But I believe that sincerity will eventually shine through the darkness.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Since we have no clear contradictions yet, we have to make a tough choice. I'll trust @Yumi for now, but I'll keep a close eye on everything.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
